#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_WilliamIntro"
msgid ""
"The rich atmosphere of the mountain\n"
"has elevated my psychic power!\p"
"A mere child like you…\n"
"You dream of winning?$"
msgstr ""
"这座山浓厚的气息\n"
"提升了我的超能力！\p"
"像你这样的小孩子……\n"
"也妄想获胜吗？$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_WilliamDefeat"
msgid "I drown in self-pity…$"
msgstr "我沉浸在自怜之中……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_WilliamPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My psychic powers have surely\n"
"grown several times, but…$"
msgstr ""
"我的超能力确实\n"
"增强了好几倍，可是……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_KaylaIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\p"
"This is no place for children, least\n"
"of all you!$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈哈！\p"
"这里不是小孩子该来的地方，\n"
"尤其是你！$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_KaylaDefeat"
msgid "I lost that cleanly…$"
msgstr "我输得这么彻底……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_KaylaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This means my training is still not\n"
"enough…\p"
"I've got to keep working toward the\n"
"summit…\p"
"Go, me!$"
msgstr ""
"这说明我的修行还不够……\p"
"我得继续向山顶努力……\p"
"加油，我！$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleIntro"
msgid "Why have you come here?$"
msgstr "你为什么到这里来？$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleDefeat"
msgid ""
"That was amazing!\n"
"You're a very special TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""
"太厉害了！\n"
"你是一位非常特别的训练家。$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:70
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabriellePostBattle"
msgid ""
"POKéMON no longer of this world.\n"
"POKéMON that are with you now.\p"
"And the POKéMON that you will meet\n"
"in the future…\p"
"They are all to be equally cherished.\n"
"Please remember that.$"
msgstr ""
"已经不在这个世上的宝可梦，\n"
"现在和你在一起的宝可梦，\p"
"还有你将来会遇到的宝可梦……\p"
"它们都同样值得珍惜。\n"
"请记住这一点。$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:78
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleRegister"
msgid ""
"I would like to see your POKéMON\n"
"when they grow up some more…\p"
"Please, I need to see your POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"我想看看你的宝可梦\n"
"再成长一些之后的样子……\p"
"请让我看看你的宝可梦导航。$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:83
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you…\p"
"Have you come to show me your grown\n"
"POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是你啊……\p"
"你是来让我看看\n"
"你成长后的宝可梦的吗？$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"How amazing!\n"
"You are a special person.$"
msgstr ""
"太厉害了！\n"
"你是一个特别的人。$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_3F/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "MtPyre_3F_Text_GabriellePostRematch"
msgid ""
"POKéMON no longer of this world.\n"
"POKéMON that are with you now.\p"
"And the POKéMON that you will meet\n"
"in the future…\p"
"They are all to be equally cherished.\n"
"I see that you've remembered that.$"
msgstr ""
"已经不在这个世上的宝可梦，\n"
"现在和你在一起的宝可梦，\p"
"还有你将来会遇到的宝可梦……\p"
"它们都同样值得珍惜。\n"
"看来你一直记着这一点。$"
